# An error state that is a product defect, kept as a tour so the defect stays on record: picking a
# workflow in "SageFs: Switch Workflow" fails with "unknown workflow ''". The extension posts the
# choice without a Content-Length (Node sends it chunked) and the daemon's workflow route only reads
# a body that has one. Delete this tour when the route reads a chunked body. Two sizes.
resize 1280 800
expect-text SageFs
wait 12
click SageFs
wait 2
command SageFs: Create Session
wait 2
key enter
expect-session --within 240
wait 3
command SageFs: Switch Session
wait 2
type {session}
key enter
wait 3

command SageFs: Switch Workflow
wait 2
shot workflow-picker-1280x800
key down
key down
key enter
wait 5
shot workflow-error-1280x800 --region statusbar --region sidebar

resize 1024 700
wait 2
shot workflow-error-1024x700 --region statusbar
